      <p class="entry-kicker">04 · LOCAL RUN RESULTS</p>
      <h2 id="local-results">Local run results</h2>
      <p>These timings came from local runs. A three-owner run took 2m33s from request to final report. An earlier three-owner run took 3m09s from request to final report. Solo setup took 6.6s, and setup to final report took 5m03s.</p>
      <p>In the three-owner run, bob used Python 3.9.6 and initially failed step 4. carol used Python 3.12.15 and passed. In the solo run, the volunteer used Python 3.9.6 and initially failed. The approved local change let the rerun pass.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

