      <p class="entry-kicker">06 · LIMITATIONS</p>
      <h2 id="limitations">Limitations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The three test environments ran on one Mac and differed by Python version.</li>
        <li>No real Windows or Linux machine and no remote enrollment were tested.</li>
        <li>The guardrails are not a sandbox.</li>
        <li>Free model availability and limits can change.</li>
        <li>Fixes are suggestions, not pull requests. A human applies any project change.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="setup.html">Read the setup instructions.</a></p>
